    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's certifications, GDPR instruments, AI security controls, audit capabilities, and experience with EU regulatory frameworks (GDPR, EU AI Act, RGS, SecNumCloud, NIS2) as of 2024, how can our company's ensure that our company's tender response demonstrates compliance with these security and regulatory requirements?" ;
