    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a SecurityCompliance Agent for our company's, I can assure you that our company's has the necessary certifications and experience to comply with our company's requirements. our company's are ISO 27001 certified since 2023, which covers the scope of Development, delivery, and operations, and our company's also have the ISO 27701 certification for Privacy Information Management." ;
