    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To demonstrate compliance with GDPR, our company's can highlight our company's ISO 27001 and ISO 27701 certifications, which show that our company's have implemented adequate security controls to protect personal data. our company's can also mention our company's experience with GDPR delivery, particularly with clients bound by professional secrecy, including a national professional order." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding professional secrecy and confidentiality, our company's can assure the client that our company's are familiar with professional secrecy requirements and have experience working with clients who require strict confidentiality. our company's data protection measures include encryption in transit (TLS 1.3) and at rest (AES-256), as well as pseudonymisation and data minimisation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address anti-money laundering obligations (LCB-FT), our company's can mention our company's familiarity with the LCB-FT framework and our company's commitment to not undermining a firm's reporting obligations. our company's also have experience with statutory audit principles, including auditor independence and separation of duties. our company's solution, Atelier, is designed to provide reliability and traceability of outputs, and our company's can guarantee complete audit trail and explainability. our company's also support internal quality control and statutory audit review, which demonstrates our company's commitment to professional responsibility and independence." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding data sovereignty, our company's can assure the client that our company's hosting partner, OuraneCloud, is SecNumCloud qualified, which means that our company's can provide sovereign hosting of confidential data within EU. is complies with the client requirement for data to be hosted in EU and not transferred outside EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Finally, our company's can demonstrate our company's compliance with legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents by highlighting our company's experience with regulatory frameworks and our company's ability to provide configurable retention aligned with legal archival obligations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, I believe that our company's has the necessary certifications, experience, and security controls to comply with the client security and regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

